  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.1.0\n\n    - Added public path construction from node identifiers and incoming connection costs\n    - Optimized path construction and concatenation to reduce allocations and unnecessary copies\n    - Optimized connection enumeration for arrays and lists while preserving custom IEnumerable behavior\n    - Cached heuristic estimates for the duration of each search\n    - Fixed reconstructed path costs when equal-cost parent selection changes\n    - Clarified node-map and heuristic-provider contracts",
